
# Write the English subject on the first line.
# Format: type(scope): summary
# Breaking change: type(scope)!: summary
# Allowed types: feat fix docs refactor perf test build ci chore revert
# scope is required: start with a lowercase letter and use only lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.
# Keep the whole subject within 72 characters; start the summary with a lowercase letter and omit the final period.
# Examples:
# docs(readme): clarify the development status
# fix(courseware-core): preserve element ids when saving
# feat(courseware-core)!: revise the courseware format
# Add a short body after a blank line only when the diff alone is hard to understand.
# Check English clarity and verb usage during review.
# Do not add Co-Authored-By trailers or AI attributions.
# Validate a message file: pnpm lint:commits --edit <file>
